# Raw REAL-world datasets referenced by data/provenance/manifest.json are
# never committed to the repository. This directory holds them (and only them)
# on a working machine; the manifest records each file's SHA-256 so a later
# verification step can confirm an uncommitted file matches what was registered.
#
# Only this .gitignore and README.md may be tracked.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md